00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:40.280
And W...

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.240
And X...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.320
And I saw 'em all when they first aired!

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.570
You could call it passion...

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.080
...or my duty as a fan!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:47.830
In that case...

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.620
...would you watch Gu*dam: The Serial Murder Case...

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.920
...or Detective Gunda* if they started airing?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.670
As a Gu***m fan...

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.460
...I suppose that I have a **** to watch it.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.170
**** is kinda...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.420
But it's a ***** you can't call it by a letter.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.470
All this talk about **ndam has reminded me...

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:09.890
Despite appearances, I'm already *** years older than *muro.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.640
Time passed in a *****.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.180
And in two more years...

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.100
...I'll be the same age as B****t-san.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.480
Can't even imagine it!

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.810
Well, you know...

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:21.320
B****t-san is a pretty *** character, even in the Gu***m world.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.650
Same goes for Ha**n-sama...

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:22.990
Actually...

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.030
You're ***** for your age...

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:28.370
...so I wouldn't use *** for a standard.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:31.330
You could at least say that I look ***** for my age.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:31.870
Nah.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.620
You're so cute!

