00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.000
What?

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:42.820
A pot?

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.130
You grew up to be my kind of girl!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.260
Such a cutie.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.850
It's hot, Dad.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.060
