00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.820
Morning already, huh...

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.190
I got wasted last night...

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:06.780
...so I figured I'd be out till noon...

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.610
Guess I'm still young.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:11.830
This is the morning news for Monday, July 2nd.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:12.610
Early this morning, a man at a restaurant...

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.490
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:14.790
<i>What about Sunday?</i>

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:15.000
<i>What happened to my day off?!</i>

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.660
...yelled, "Hey, this ramen sucks!"

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:16.870
<i>What happened to my day off?!</i>

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:22.340
I always plan on studying for tests at night...

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.710
...but I end up getting sleepy.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.130
So I asked Sis for advice...

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.640
<i>You don't like horror movies, right?</i>

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.800
<i>If you watched one...</i>

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.930
<i>...wouldn't that keep you up all night?</i>

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:35.640
<i>Seeing how you crawled into my bed last time.</i>

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.020
And so...

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.690
...I didn't get sleepy after watching it.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:42.360
An older sister knows just what to do.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.650
But then...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.230
...once it's night...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:48.820
...the slightest sound from behind would make me jump...

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:52.200
...which made it even harder to focus on studying.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:55.120
And I ended up not getting enough sleep...

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.250
...so I was tired in class.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.960
But for someone who claims to dislike horror...

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.790
...you watch those movies quite often.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.880
It's not that I choose to watch them...

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:07.220
My mother's the same way.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.630
<i>Hey, Miyuki.</i>

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.840
<i>I rented this.</i>

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:10.890
<i>Want to watch?</i>

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.720
<i>It's too scary by myself.</i>

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.180
The people who can't stand it...

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:17.100
...actually watch them more often, right?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.760
Perhaps they want to be scared.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.390
<i>You're wrong, Yuki-chan!</i>

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:23.900
<i>In my case, I really can't stand them!</i>

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.610
Iwasaki-san.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.110
Do you know the answer to this one?

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.610
I worked on it for a while...

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.660
...and I couldn't figure it out...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.410
...so I was going to ask Miyuki-san.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.410
I see.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:41.580
We're really lucky to have
upperclassmen to rely on in these situations.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:45.130
I was talking with Iwasaki-san about that at school today.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:46.300
<i>What?!</i>

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.510
<i>She has that much faith in me?!</i>

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:53.340
<i>This girl is going to soon discover
how the world is a very harsh place!</i>

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.610
Hey, Cousin Yui.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:00.810
Did you ever study together with Cousin K?

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:01.810
