00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:29.710
M-Maybe it's 'cause I went to a different school.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.220
I never learned this stuff.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:32.930
I see.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.640
<i>I-It hurts...</i>

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.970
<i>Now I'm stuck...</i>

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.270
Cousin Yui, do you know this one?

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.730
You probably don't!

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.890
Don't ask if you don't think I know it.

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:46.310
Didn't you see what just happened?

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:47.570
Man...

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.730
Maybe I'll call Miyuki-san.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.280
Might be a bother for her though.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:51.900
Well...

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.900
It'll probably be a bother.

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:54.860
Since it's late.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.280
<i>Why does she never...</i>

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:59.790
<i>...turn to her dad in these situations?</i>

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.040
<i>Rely on me sometimes!</i>

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.120
