00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:04.870
Izumi.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.170
Don't sleep in class.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.090
We live in an age where corporal punishment isn't allowed...

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.500
...yet you often hit people like it's no big deal.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.340
Not that I have a problem with it.

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.300
That's true.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.340
But I don't hit just anybody.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:17.720
I choose my targets very carefully, if you get my drift.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:19.060
Else I could get in trouble.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.890
<i>She actually said it.</i>

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.560
<i>Another crazy thing about her.</i>

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.690
Besides, it doesn't make sense to ban corporal punishment.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:26.650
Okay.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.400
That's all for today.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.820
Miyuki-san, sorry.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.900
I don't know these era names.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:33.940
Yuki-chan.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.570
Teach me how to do this one.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:36.660
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.910
<i>So like...</i>

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.530
<i>...why don't you ever ask your teacher?!</i>

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.500
Ms. Kuroi!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.330
Izumi, what's up?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.120
Well...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.830
I had a question...

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:47.670
Oh.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:48.830
Ask away then.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:49.670
