00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:02.720
It's always sweltering after a hurricane.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:05.730
We had a lot of instances of good weather after a storm.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.520
Stormy weather flock together.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.240
Not bad.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.270
By the way, what wasn't bad?

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.940
Just to make sure...

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.570
...that was supposed to be a joke, right?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.200
Um...

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:22.990
I wanted to ask you something...

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.050
What's up this time?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.330
About this morning...

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.000
Did Kona-chan say something weird?

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.260
I couldn't tell what was wrong...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.380
<i>We watch the news and stuff together...</i>

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.510
<i>...so why is she at Konata's level?</i>

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:56.940
