00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.530
I see.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.660
Third-years focus on studying for college testing...

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.040
...so they don't have much homework, huh?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.370
Konata...

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.290
You...

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:51.960
Huh..

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.680
