00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.230
But it's so hot lately.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:06.600
You know...

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.020
It's like that thing the Diet's doing.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:09.060
Cool Biz?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:09.730
Yeah, that!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.020
No, that's something different.

