00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:30.200
Your casual slip-ups are always so cute.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.330
Really?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.420
Pretty sure they just cause trouble.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.080
You have no idea.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.630
The way she's all embarrassed when
she tries to make up for the mistake is killer.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:41.420
It's cuter when you have some kind of shortcoming.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:42.380
What?

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:43.630
So at your job...

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.220
I spilled it!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.260
I'm so sorry, sir!

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.520
You do stuff like that?

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:50.520
