00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.970
You geeks can be really harsh sometimes...

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.600
If we get a perfect answer...

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.220
...courtesy of Look JT*...

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:35.730
...we have a one-month journey through the tundra for the prize.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:36.020
On variety shows and quiz shows...

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.730
Now, let us begin.
On variety shows and quiz shows...

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.650
On variety shows and quiz shows...

