Here you will find kangaroos, koalas, and other wild animals.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.040
Well, I don't really know.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:54.660
But you know...

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:54.900
Here you will find kangaroos, koalas, and other wild animals.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.500
If they let the audience participate...

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:57.580
...and gave them the prizes...

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.460
This continent, separated long ago by tectonic movement...

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.890
...wouldn't that boost ratings even more?

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:02.050
This continent, separated long ago by tectonic movement...

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:02.200
...has transformed into a holy land safe from foreign intrusion.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.090
I have to agree...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.180
...but that's a direct way to do business.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.640
Morning!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:08.720
Yo.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.220
I was playing a game yesterday when I realized something...

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:16.030
Who's our school idol?

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:19.360
What is this school idol?

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.820
Like a Miss contest or something?

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:22.940
Yeah...

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.490
That's what you would think...

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.900
It's more theoretical in games...

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.490
With stuff like personal bodyguards.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.760
Another exhausting day...

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.670
So refreshing!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.760
I have to leave early tomorrow.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.050
Guess I should stay off the Internet tonight...

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.300
...and hit the sack.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.800
Don't want to be late.

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.770
<i>I'm starting to prioritize sleep...</i>

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.980
<i>Is it a sign I'm getting old?</i>

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:00.490
<i>When I was in school, I skipped sleep to have fun...</i>

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.290
Ta-Tamura-san...

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.500
Is something wrong?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.410
You've been making a lot of faces...

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:19.420
Well...

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.670
You know how when you're drawing...

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:23.500
...you tend to make the same faces as your characters?

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.880
Really...

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.380
So you were drawing.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:29.870
I didn't know that you drew manga, Tamura-san.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.680
They're mostly doujin...

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:34.150
What kind of manga do you draw?

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.230
Um...

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.100
Normal stuff like four panels...

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:43.110
O-Or romance stuff with...

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.410
...game characters I like...

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.070
<i>So hard to answer...</i>

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:53.370
The other day, I won 3,000 yen
with a lottery ticket I randomly bought.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.010
I was thinking how lucky I was that morning.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:58.160
Amazing!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.920
But then my bicycle tire burst on the
way to school so I had to pay for repairs.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:05.340
And my box lunch was ruined so I had to
buy another one from a convenience store.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:08.420
The money vanished so perfectly...

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.010
My 3,000 yen...

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.680
Truth is stranger than fiction...

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:13.430
...I suppose.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:15.100
But you know...

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:18.220
I figure I can use this story for manga...

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.980
...so it's okay...

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.350
<i>She's strong...</i>

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.370
Th-The drawing hand...

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.510
...is an artist's all...

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.170
Must defend it with my life...

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.460
<i>Sh-She's strong...</i>

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.470
You really are skilled.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:56.100
Nah...

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.850
I've been in a slump...

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.720
That one's a bust.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.820
But this is probably one of my better recent ones.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.440
Yeah...

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:13.150
Other people aren't going to notice...

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.950
...the artist's habits or subtle touches...

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.410
I already knew that...

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.240
Crap!

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.250
What's wrong, Tamura-san?

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:26.880
I left my favourite pencil on my
desk after I finished drawing yesterday.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.000
Want to borrow mine?

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.000
No...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.170
I'm no good without her...

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:34.340
It just feels totally different...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.180
Yeah...

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:41.280
Pencils are all the same, right?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:43.270
I know it's true...

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.890
Of course that's how people would react...

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:50.700
So I ended up lost and couldn't get out for three hours.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.660
What's wrong, Tamura-san?

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.410
<i>S-So embarrassing...</i>

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:03.160
<i>The hell are they thinking, wearing that in broad daylight?</i>

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:04.300
A coat?

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.540
Aren't they hot wearing so much in summer?

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:12.550
<i>So only people who understand can feel the agony...</i>

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:13.340
Hold on.

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:15.090
I need to message someone.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:17.300
Welcome!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.260
Sure is crowded.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.080
I'll go write my name on the sheet.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:22.810
So I was up all night playing games with Big Sister Konata.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:23.970
Suzaku-sama!

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:26.690
Suzaku-sama, party of three!

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:27.040
So I was up all night playing games with Big Sister Konata.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.320
They called us.

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:29.810
But Tamura-san...

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.270
They called a different name.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.770
In these situations...

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:36.610
...I always want to put down the name of my favourite character.

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:40.320
It, like, makes me feel closer to the character.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.460
<i>You can find my people...</i>

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:52.420
<i>...everywhere!</i>

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.550
Thanks.

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:05.430
I wish I could be all slender...

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:08.360
...and tall like you, Iwasaki-san.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:13.770
I admire you so much, Minami-chan.

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:14.940
So...

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.160
Yutaka...

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.830
You'll still grow.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.870
Perhaps...

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.460
...you'll grow even taller than me.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:27.330
Taller than you?

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:33.790
Minami-chan!

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.800
No!

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.420
That goes against natural world order!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.380
And the last one's totally off!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.550
Calm down, girl!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:42.930
Tamura-san, are you okay?

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.510
You look kinda pale.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:47.890
Actually...

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.850
...today's the submission deadline for an upcoming event...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.940
...and I was up all night finishing...

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:56.740
I just sent it out...

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:02.320
But when I look at how hard I can work on something...

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:05.740
...I feel like I'm shining.

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.950
<i>She's strong...</i>

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.960
Tamura-san!

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:12.540
What's yaoi?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:21.010
Which definition are you looking for...

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.020
Good lucky!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.940
We're already on the nineteenth episode of Lucky Channel!

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.940
Looks like we're finally in the home stretch!

00:18:35.310 --> 00:18:37.940
I'm your navigator, Akira Kogami!

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.820
And I'm the assistant, Minoru Shiraishi!

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:42.360
It's a pleasure.

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:42.780
Net Darling!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.610
Anyway...

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:43.820
Da-Da Darling!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:44.740
Akira-sama appears to be in a good mood today.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.910
Can't do anything about adult circumstances.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.080
Did something good happen?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:48.240
Can't do anything about adult circumstances.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.620
What do you think?

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.410
Uh...

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.210
N-Never mind...

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.180
Being on TV really puts a strain on my nerves.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.300
The stress really builds up after nineteen episodes.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.970
I wish I could just soak in a spa and recuperate.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:09.060
Maybe I can win that prize they
were talking about in the actual show.

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:09.470
That's like!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:10.770
In that case...

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:14.480
...you have to start by appearing in the quiz show, right?

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:18.320
Crap...

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.110
Oh, yeah!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.610
Traveling is great!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.280
I'd love to travel!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.740
Going someplace you've never been...

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.240
...really lightens your mood!

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.750
It rules!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.830
Do you like to travel?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.990
But of course!

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:31.080
I love to!

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.290
I've actually been to many places!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:34.540
I've climbed Mt. Takao!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.830
And I've been to Jogashima!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.300
I'm definitely the outdoors type!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:40.710
So you like to travel.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:43.220
When you want to calm yourself down these days...

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:47.770
...nothing can beat a stroll through the splendor of a pristine forest!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.140
Sounds great...

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.010
A stroll through a pristine forest.

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.970
Must really calm the soul.

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:54.020
Right?

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.520
Away from the hustle and bustle of the city...

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:57.400
...surrendering yourself to the tranquility of nature...

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.820
It heals both the body and soul!

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:01.530
Sounds good.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:03.150
Nature might be nice.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.530
Isn't nature great?!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.490
Wanna go on a walk through the forest?

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:07.950
Seriously?!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:08.700
Can I?

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.870
Well, if I can...

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:10.490
...I will!

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:10.620
Okay.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:10.990
Shankya!

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:13.590
Then Minoru's Nature Tour's a go.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:14.790
Huge.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.050
Take 'em.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:19.800
Guess they'll come in handy...

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.590
Where...

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:23.000
...am I going...

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:23.660
...exactly...

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.510
Mt. Fuji.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:25.630
But...

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.470
I've already been to the mountains...

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:28.720
Not the mountain.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.430
The forest.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:30.930
Go to the forests of Fuji.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.900
The forests, huh?

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.820
Who is...

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.650
I am...

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.150
Uh...

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:44.230
What am I supposed to do there?

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.070
Bring me water.

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:46.740
Water?

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.490
I wanna drink some of that famous Fuji water...

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.740
...so go get me some.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.120
No way!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:52.490
Don't they sell that stuff at convenience stores?!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.000
I want mine fresh!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.290
I won't be alone, right?

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:57.790
Alone!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.370
Alone?!

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.130
Someone's coming with me, right?!

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.630
Don't worry.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:05.590
The director and producer are sacrificing themselves to go with you.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:06.840
Lucky you.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:07.470
Oh, my saviour!

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:08.010
Come on!

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:08.960
Stop wasting time!

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:09.010
Don't miss the deadline.
Stop wasting time!

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:09.840
Don't miss the deadline.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:10.590
No!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:11.460
Please let me go!

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.850
We're already out of time!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:13.310
Everybody!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:13.810
Then...

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:13.850
I'll do it myself!
Everybody!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.310
We'll have a wonderful guest next time...

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:16.020
Stop!

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.060
Please stop!

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:17.480
We'll have a wonderful guest next time...

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:21.100
...here on Lucky Channel!

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.310
You can expect something great!

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:22.860
Ow!

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.520
Bye-bee!

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:25.230
Let go of me!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:28.530
Did we really need to go through all this trouble to get rid of him?

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:29.280
Could have just...

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.520
Part of my body is hot! Hot!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:33.920
Hello!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:34.790
Minoru Shiraishi here!

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.560
Now, please listen to me!

00:23:01.010 --> 00:23:03.400
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:04.480
I'm Nanako.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.320
I'm Yui-chan!

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:07.610
I've been thinkin'...

00:23:07.610 --> 00:23:08.700
Summer's like...

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:12.620
You get all excited before it starts...

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.130
...but before you know it, it's over and nothing happened, right?

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:18.910
Well, I guess nothing special ever happens.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:24.130
'Sides, you're not gonna have a long relationship with anybody you meet during fling season.

00:23:24.740 --> 00:23:26.460
I wouldn't know...

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.590
Well, we've still got time.

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.180
Let's both work hard.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.390
Yes?

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:33.180
Hard to answer...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:33.890
Next time:

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:35.850
How to Spend Summer!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:37.520
I'm available!
